From: tsm-consultz <brightmindsfinancial@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 20:32:33 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Mortgage vertical (war room, strategist, exec portal)

- New three-page pattern under html/war-rooms/mortgage/ (war room,
  strategist, executive portal), gold-accent theme distinct from
  Real Estate.
- mortgage-engine.js: KPIs, SLA breach detection, stage WIP,
  closing-delay + compliance financial exposure model, relay
  payload builder, canonical-core wiring.
- mortgage-model.json: loan_file/condition/exception entities +
  sample data seeded from existing REO-PRO character set.
- server.js: new /api/mortgage/query endpoint using the existing
  (previously unused) SP.mortgage system prompt.
- relay.core.js: MORTGAGE domain added to allowlist.
- tsm-doc-search-multi.html: new top-level Mortgage vtab (gold),
  VERTICALS.mtg block, WAR_ROOM_ROUTES entries, and all 25 REO-PRO
  Mortgage Rescue Pack docs tagged into the mtg vertical alongside
  their existing re/leg/fo/ins/con tags.
